The spine (canonical envelopes, the verify-before-parse gate, the order-independent materialiser with its role tree,
RGA text, the transparency-log vault, double-entry books, data leases and crypto-shredding, the node, the
deterministic simulator, the AI-native office cost kernel), the AI layer (brain routing and adoption, the mesh,
