The brains are the Konomi SLM (sjgant80-hub/konomi-slm): knowledge in a verified, readable pattern library — each
pattern earns its place by predicting held-out cases or is cut, and the model answers from a verified pattern or
abstains. The answer path in src/brain.mjs is ported from it. Powered by the Konomi architecture, created by
THOMAS FRUMKIN.

